1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,953
A careful point of language.

2
00:00:01,953 --> 00:00:04,531
A system contains internal energy.

3
00:00:04,531 --> 00:00:06,276
It does not contain heat.

4
00:00:06,276 --> 00:00:09,791
Heat is energy on the move across the boundary.

5
00:00:09,791 --> 00:00:13,372
So never say the system has two hundred joules of heat.

6
00:00:13,372 --> 00:00:16,236
Say it absorbed two hundred joules of heat.

